nine url keys nothing defined

A whole tree sweep of the runtime, undefined minus defined across all 1349 Mach-O files, leaves 300
symbols that NOTHING exports. Nine of them are NSURL constants, and a constant is the worst kind to
be missing: dyld stops on the first one an application touches, in an order nobody controls, and the
application dies before it can report anything useful.

They were neither defined nor declared here, so the value is the name, which is the convention every
other key in this file already follows.

Measured by the sweep: GAP 300 to 291, defined total 416162 to 416171, exactly nine either way.

